    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration;
    sssom:subject_label "Citation dcterms children"@en;
    sssom:object_label "dcterms passthrough";
    sssom:comment "`Citation/dcterms:source|conformsTo|accessRights|accrualPeriodicity|modified` -> same properties on Dataset. Whole-value URIs or catalogue `Label (https://…)` -> IRI; else language-tagged literal." .

