      <https://code.europa.eu/healthdataeu/healthdcat-ap/-/work_items/61> ;
    sssom:comment "csvw:datatype 1..1 Literal (CSVWColumnShape / #7+#8). RecommendedDataType → CSVW built-in name (string, integer, decimal, float, double, unsignedInt, long, date, dateTime, boolean). Fallbacks: Text|CodeRepresentation→string, Numeric→decimal, DateTime→dateTime; else string. Not an XSD IRI." .


